SUMMARY:Ranger-Led Glass-Bottom River Ecology Boat Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join a park ranger on the world’s largest freshwater spring basin for an ecology boat tour observing alligators\, manatees\, and rare native water birds.
LOCATION:Edward Ball Wakulla Springs State Park
URL:https://www.floridastateparks.org/events/wakulla-springs-ranger-boat-tour
CATEGORIES:outdoors,family
