SUMMARY:Wakulla Ancient Cypress Canopy & Wildlife Walk
DESCRIPTION:Guided interpretive nature walk along the Sally Ward Spring Trail exploring ancient bald cypress trees and karst limestone geological formations.
LOCATION:Edward Ball Wakulla Springs State Park
URL:https://www.floridastateparks.org/events/cypress-canopy-wildlife-walk
